{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量本地推-本地推\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量本地推\"],\"capability_summary\":\"该接口目前仅支持标准投放，且营销目的为团购成交/门店引流/内容加热的创编视频获取，暂不支持标准投放中的获取线索链路及全域投放。需配合【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token，推门店时商品锚点需为所推门店下挂载的商品，门店下挂载的商品id可通过【根据门店ID查询门店下商品ID】接口获取。\",\"id\":\"local.file_video_aweme.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/local/file/video/aweme/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1808004088768608\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要通过此接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"get_product_ids_by_poi_id\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"推门店时商品锚点需为所推门店下挂载的商品，需通过此接口获取门店下挂载的商品id\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"根据门店ID查询门店下商品ID\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1808004088768608\",\"title\":\"获取抖音主页视频\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E6pnv%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Col%20data-id%3D%5C%22o9d5df12-G5M8367f%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-vFIvplvn%5C%22%3E%E8%AF%A5%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E7%9B%AE%E5%89%8D%E4%BB%85%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E8%90%A5%E9%94%80%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BA%E5%9B%A2%E8%B4%AD%E6%88%90%E4%BA%A4%2F%E9%97%A8%E5%BA%97%E5%BC%95%E6%B5%81%2F%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%8A%A0%E7%83%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%88%9B%E7%BC%96%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%EF%BC%8C%E6%9A%82%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%20%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E7%BA%BF%E7%B4%A2%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%A8%E5%9F%9F%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Fol%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-G5M8367f\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-vFIvplvn\">该接口目前仅支持标准投放，且营销目的为团购成交/门店引流/内容加热的创编视频获取，暂不支持标准投放 中的获取线索链路及全域投放</li></ol></div></div></div><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1806604315427908%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22OHu5p%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-6oG8mlwC\" id=\"h346b9f0-6oG8mlwC\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-XtmQBBGI\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/local/file/video/aweme/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/local/file/video/aweme/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1808004088768608\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-m51k5MYk\" id=\"h346b9f0-m51k5MYk\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-JCjU2cHF\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-QL6AkWy4\" id=\"h346b9f0-QL6AkWy4\">请求Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ju0V4Bhr\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-InGvx2Hu\" id=\"h346b9f0-InGvx2Hu\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">local_account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CJPhmvpO\">本地推投放账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yoTMjuuP\">过滤字段</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">anchor_info</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DsAhMUyg\">视频挂载的锚点信息</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">anchor_types</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KJ9p3WYn\">根据视频所挂载的锚点类型筛选（注意：请按照项目设置和下方说明传入对应的锚点类型枚举），允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-cehM7cU1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-E6qRB6Hx\"><code>ALL_ANCHOR</code>不限制锚点</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QGvD9kzL\"><code>POI_ANCHOR</code> 门店锚点</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2nFzOvW5\"><code>PRODUCT_ANCHOR</code> 商品锚点</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-7TfsAgCV\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-asZdLM9Y\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"><strong>本地推创编选择抖音主页视频范围说明：</strong></span></p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-4nlTkdR8\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RAtN3j8r\">营销场景=短视频/图文，且营销目的=团购成交/门店引流/内容加热时：</li></ol><ol data-id=\"odaa5e75-acLghZob\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8W6T6GIY\">推门店时，支持选择<code>POI_ANCHOR</code>门店锚点和<code>PRODUCT_ANCHOR</code>商品锚点的抖音主页视频；需同时传入anchor_types和poi_ids/product_ids，其中，门店锚点需为项目所投放的门店，<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">商品锚点需为所推门店下挂载的商品，门店下挂载的商品id可通过<strong>【根据门店ID查询门店下商品ID】</strong>接口获取。</span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-btYCiTE0\">商品投放时，支持选择<code>PRODUCT_ANCHOR</code>商品锚点的抖音主页视频；需同时传入anchor_types和product_ids，其中商品锚点需为项目所投放的商品。</li></ol><ol data-id=\"oa950d4e-D8GEJZNK\" start=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KB90ndeU\">营销场景=直播时，支持选择抖音主页下全部视频，即<code>ALL_ANCHOR</code>不限制锚点</li></ol></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">poi_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AmlWDvOy\">投放的门店ids，anchor_types=<code>POI_ANCHOR</code>时必传</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">product_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-23bDZWAW\">投放的商品ids，anchor_types=<code>PRODUCT_ANCHOR</code>时必传</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RxptPXZa\">抖音号ids筛选，当anchor_types=<code>ALL_ANCHOR</code>时必传</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">item_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lpnu3XJT\">主页视频ids筛选，一次最大长度限制<code>10</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">item_status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hAFBbN3x\">素材状态筛选，默认可用 可选值:</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-8Yvmupqv\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eiZgpQql\"><code>ALL</code> 全部状态(可用&amp;不可用)</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JdSMQI4b\"><code>VALID</code> 可用状态</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-mDAVFnyl\">默认值：<code>VALID</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-q0BdPvcS\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"></span><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">根据视频发布时间进行过滤的起始时间，与end_time搭配使用，格式：</span><code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss</span></code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nKccDstv\">根据视频发布时间进行过滤的截止时间，与start_time搭配使用，格式：<code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss</span></code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_filed</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MSrluSjH\">排序字段，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-ymYlLWhD\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-iZgEu9gI\"><code>ARRIVE_SHOP</code> 到店量排序</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZHuI7dym\"><code>ESTIMATE</code> 预估效果排序</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hhfcMr5q\"><code>LIKE_CNT</code> 点赞量排序</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8ozgbs1D\"><code>PAY_ORDER_CNT</code> 成交量排序</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-DhhkuIUn\"><code>PUBLISH_TIME</code> 发布时间排序</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">external_action</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5YMbLtXK\">转化目标，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-0dQCAlhd\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cuZCFyXh\"><code>OTO_PAY</code> 团购购买（默认值）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZXToycLv\"><code>POI_RECOMMEND</code> 门店引流</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-c9HTlQqw\">仅order_filed= <code>ESTIMATE</code> 预估效果排序时有效</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">count</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-X10CnHcU\">页面数据量，默认<code>10</code>，最大值<code>100</code>，最小值<code>1</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">cursor</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zBeBAot1\">页码游标值，第一次传<code>0</code>，之后每次传上一次请求返回的游标值</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-JtIRRfyc\" id=\"h346b9f0-JtIRRfyc\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Flocal%2Ffile%2Fvideo%2Faweme%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20